    "updated_at": "2022-07-02T18:57:39Z",
    "body": "I updated to the dev branch, but know am seeing a new error: (size = 3)\r\n\r\n```\r\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nValueError                                Traceback (most recent call last)\r\nInput In [18], in <cell line: 14>()\r\n     62 mcs[-1].append(energy / q.results.optimized[\"optimized cost\"])\r\n     64 q = QAOA()\r\n---> 65 problem = Knapsack.random_instance(n_items=size, quantum=True, seed=seed).get_qubo_problem()\r\n     66 energy, _ = ground_state_hamiltonian(problem.hamiltonian)\r\n     67 if energy < 1:\r\n\r\nFile ~\\Documents\\openqaoa-dev\\openqaoa\\problems\\problem.py:490, in Knapsack.random_instance(cls, **kwargs)\r\n    488 values = list(map(int, np.random.randint(1, n_items, size=n_items)))\r\n    489 weights = list(map(int, np.random.randint(1, n_items, size=n_items)))\r\n--> 490 weight_capacity = np.random.randint(np.min(weights) * n_items, np.max(weights) * n_items)\r\n    491 penalty = 2 * np.max(values)\r\n    493 return cls(values, weights, weight_capacity, penalty)\r\n\r\nFile mtrand.pyx:746, in numpy.random.mtrand.RandomState.randint()\r\n\r\nFile _bounded_integers.pyx:1338, in numpy.random._bounded_integers._rand_int32()\r\n\r\nValueError: low >= high\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
